---
// Phone app: JS layer, native modules, system apps, relay.
---
<figure class="arch arch-scroll" role="img" aria-labelledby="ap-t" data-aria-en="Phone app architecture" data-aria-zh="手机端架构图">
  <span id="ap-t" class="sr"><span data-l="en">Expo Router screens and React Native components sit on a logic layer with the chat stream, a tool loop and zustand stores. Companion tools write ledger lines with undo. System actions go through Expo modules and two local native modules: Swift for AlarmKit on iOS and Kotlin for Shizuku and alarms on Android. The computer remote uses Noise IK in pure JavaScript with per-computer keys in the keychain.</span><span data-l="zh">Expo Router 页面和 React Native 组件建在逻辑层之上：对话流、工具循环和 zustand 状态。伙伴的工具会写一行可撤销的「账本」。系统动作通过 Expo 模块和两个本地原生模块：iOS 上用 Swift 接 AlarmKit，Android 上用 Kotlin 接 Shizuku 和闹钟。电脑遥控用纯 JavaScript 的 Noise IK，每台电脑的密钥存在钥匙串里。</span></span>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1100 400" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs><marker id="ap-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="rgba(255,255,255,.5)"/></marker></defs>
    <rect class="box am" x="10" y="20" width="560" height="360" rx="22" style="fill:#14110e"/>
    <text class="sub" x="32" y="48">AOGIRI APP · Expo 57 · React Native 0.86 · TypeScript</text>
    <rect class="box" x="32" y="66" width="160" height="80" rx="12"/><text class="lbl" x="48" y="94">伙伴 Companion</text><text class="sub" x="48" y="114">chat · Lumen</text><text class="sub" x="48" y="130">ledger + undo</text>
    <rect class="box" x="208" y="66" width="160" height="80" rx="12"/><text class="lbl" x="224" y="94">今天 Today</text><text class="sub" x="224" y="114">agenda · check-in</text><text class="sub" x="224" y="130">diary calendar</text>
    <rect class="box" x="384" y="66" width="164" height="80" rx="12"/><text class="lbl" x="400" y="94">电脑 Computer</text><text class="sub" x="400" y="114">sessions · plan</text><text class="sub" x="400" y="130">approvals · dispatch</text>
    <rect class="box" x="32" y="164" width="516" height="62" rx="12"/><text class="lbl" x="48" y="192">Glass chrome</text><text class="sub" x="48" y="212">bar / clear / accent materials · blur appears only when content scrolls under</text>
    <rect class="box" x="32" y="244" width="250" height="114" rx="12"/><text class="lbl" x="48" y="272">Logic (src/lib)</text><text class="sub" x="48" y="292">SSE chat stream · tool loop</text><text class="sub" x="48" y="310">zustand stores · notify</text><text class="sub" x="48" y="328">create_reminder · remember …</text>
    <rect class="box am" x="298" y="244" width="250" height="114" rx="12"/><text class="lbl" x="314" y="272">Relay client (21 files)</text><text class="sub" x="314" y="292">Noise IK in pure JS (@noble)</text><text class="sub" x="314" y="310">QR / link pairing + 6-digit code</text><text class="sub" x="314" y="328">keys in keychain · Face ID gate</text>
